    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Phase heterogeneous mixture may share the same state of matter.

For example, immiscibile liquid phases (e.g. oil and water) constitute a mixture whose phases are clearly separated but share the same state of matter.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
