    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Absiemens</rdfs:label>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The CGS electromagnetic unit of conductance; one absiemen is the conductance at which a potential of one abvolt forces a current of one abampere; equal to 10⁹ siemens. One siemen is the conductance at which a potential of one volt forces a current of one ampere and named for Karl Wilhem Siemens.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
