    <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Nailing is joining by hammering or pressing nails (wire pins) as auxiliary parts into the solid material. Several parts are joined by pressing them together (from: DIN 8593 part 3/09.85).</owl:annotatedTarget>
