  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#Stokes">
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">`Stokes (St)` is a unit in the category of Kinematic viscosity. This unit is commonly used in the cgs unit system. Stokes (St) has a dimension of L²T⁻¹ where L is length, and T is time. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit m²/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.0001.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
