    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bosonic elementary particle that mediates interactions among elementary fermions, and thus acts as a force carrier.</rdfs:comment>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">A bosonic elementary particle that mediates interactions among elementary fermions, and thus acts as a force carrier.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
