    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The class of individuals standing for causally non-convex interacting systems.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_38b579de_4331_40e0_803d_09efa298e726"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PhysicalPhenomenon</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A physical phenomenon is intended as a physical process that starts or ends with an unbonded state, or that includes incoming or aoutgoing particles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The class of individuals standing for causally non-convex interacting systems.</rdfs:comment>
