    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">"Candlepower" (abbreviated as cp) is a now-obsolete unit which was used to express levels of light intensity in terms of the light emitted by a candle of specific size and constituents. In modern usage Candlepower equates directly to the unit known as the candela.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
