  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_aaf9dd7f_0474_40d0_9606_02def8515249">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Even though torque has the same physical dimension as energy, it is not of the same kind and can not be measured with energy units like joule or electron volt.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The effectiveness of a force to produce rotation about an axis, measured by the product of the force and the perpendicular distance from the line of action of the force to the axis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Torque</rdfs:label>
