    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">The subclass of icon inspired by Peirceian category a) the image, which depends on a simple quality (e.g. picture).</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">An icon that focus on WHERE/WHEN the object is, in the sense of spatial or temporal shape.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <skos:example xml:lang="en">A geographical map that imitates the shape of the landscape and its properties at a specific historical time.</skos:example>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An icon that mimics the spatial or temporal shape of the object.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ResemblanceIcon</rdfs:label>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">An icon that mimics the spatial or temporal shape of the object.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
