  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_672e2475_8376_4987_82cf_097f0024e74b">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Constant of a chemical reaction. It is the value of its reaction quotient at chemical equilibrium, a state approached by a dynamic chemical system after sufficient time has elapsed at which its composition has no measurable tendency towards further change.</rdfs:comment>
