    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">RadianPerMinute</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Radian Per Minute (rad/min) is a unit in the category of Angular velocity. It is also known as radians per minute, radian/minute. Radian Per Minute (rad/min) has a dimension of aT-1 where T is time. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit rad/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.0166666666667.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
