    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Since measurement uncertainty is a subclass of objective property, this relation can also describe the uncertainty of an measurement uncertainty.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
