    <emmo:EMMO_705f27ae_954c_4f13_98aa_18473fc52b25 xml:lang="en">From Latin causa (“reason, sake, cause”), and Ancient Greek σύστημα (sústēma, “musical scale; organized body; whole made of several parts or members”), from σῠν- (sun-, prefix meaning ‘with, together’) + ἵστημι (hístēmi, “to stand”).</emmo:EMMO_705f27ae_954c_4f13_98aa_18473fc52b25>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Axiom"/>
