    <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A scientist that assigns a quantity to a physical objects without actually measuring it but taking it for granted due to its previous experience (e.g. considering an electron charge as 1.6027663e-19 C, assigning a molecular mass to a gas only by the fact of a name on the bottle).</skos:example>
    <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Someone who assigns a name to an object.</skos:example>
