    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">We usa a predicate template notation as DP&lt;φ&gt;(x,y) to specify subclasses of DP(x,y) for the class φ, meaning that DP&lt;φ&gt;(x, y) ≡ PP(x, y) ∧ (φ(x) ↔ ¬φ(y))</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
