    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An 'equation' that stands for a physical assumption specific to a material, and provides an expression for a 'physics_quantity' (the dependent variable) as function of other variables, physics_quantity or data (independent variables).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A material_relation can e.g. return a predefined number, return a database query, be an equation that depends on other physics_quantities.</rdfs:comment>
