    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">http://qudt.org/2.1/vocab/unit</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/units/coherentsiunits#"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Square Meter Per Mole (m2/mol) is a unit in the category of Specific Area. It is also known as square meters per mole, square metre per per, square metres per per, square meter/per, square metre/per. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. Square Meter Per Mole (m2/mol) has a dimension of M-1L2 where M is mass, and L is length. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Square Meter Per Mole (m2/mol) is a unit in the category of Specific Area. It is also known as square meters per mole, square metre per per, square metres per per, square meter/per, square metre/per. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. Square Meter Per Mole (m2/mol) has a dimension of M-1L2 where M is mass, and L is length. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">m2.mol-1</emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652>
    <emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">m²/mol</emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>
