    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The class of general mathematical symbolic objects respecting mathematical syntactic rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The class of general mathematical symbolic objects respecting mathematical syntactic rules.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">A mathematical object in this branch is not representing a concept but an actual graphical object built using mathematcal symbols arranged in some way, according to math conventions.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
