  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ec767367_a773_4935_80ea_dd6a5eaefb54">
    <emmo:EMMO_fe015383_afb3_44a6_ae86_043628697aa2 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://doi.org/10.1351/goldbook.S06167</emmo:EMMO_fe015383_afb3_44a6_ae86_043628697aa2>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">at a given point on a two-dimensional domain of quasi-infinitesimal area dA, scalar quantity equal to the mass dm within the domain divided by the area dA, thus ρA = dm/dA.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
